%%body
{
  Trading some random items here and there for readily available scrap, you've started to notice the process of recycling these scraps has been producing "Abyssal Iron" shards.

    @ Nori "Ferrous material exposed to the wiles of the abyss, maybe with enough shards we could produce something worthwhile?"

  You had to agree, but most of the scrap results in your usual lower quality materials.

  You wonder if pumping more mana into the scrap would help.

    @ Nori "That could increase the concentration of mana within the scrap, maybe forming more Abyssal Iron in the process."

}
%date 2026-07-31
